    "detailed_description": "<h1>METROIDVANIA ACTION-ADVENTURE. WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/d9cf1499fee3784d19d0d60c1b0c8f77.poster.avif?t=1685259725\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/d9cf1499fee3784d19d0d60c1b0c8f77.webm?t=1685259725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/d9cf1499fee3784d19d0d60c1b0c8f77.mp4?t=1685259725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You\u2019ve been caught into trap and now you must get out of it. You don\u2019t have any super capacity with exception to your own brain. You can only pass the room with the help of your brain, because you will have to solve the puzzle in order to open an exit. And remember - the puzzles get ever more complicated in the course of a game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Brain upgrade at every level<br></li><li>Unusual puzzles<br></li><li>Trade maps</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/3ba9fe1339217187c25637806b1818d4.poster.avif?t=1685259725\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/3ba9fe1339217187c25637806b1818d4.webm?t=1685259725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/3ba9fe1339217187c25637806b1818d4.mp4?t=1685259725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/d9cf1499fee3784d19d0d60c1b0c8f77.poster.avif?t=1685259725\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/d9cf1499fee3784d19d0d60c1b0c8f77.webm?t=1685259725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/d9cf1499fee3784d19d0d60c1b0c8f77.mp4?t=1685259725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You\u2019ve been caught into trap and now you must get out of it. You don\u2019t have any super capacity with exception to your own brain. You can only pass the room with the help of your brain, because you will have to solve the puzzle in order to open an exit. And remember - the puzzles get ever more complicated in the course of a game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Brain upgrade at every level<br></li><li>Unusual puzzles<br></li><li>Trade maps</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/3ba9fe1339217187c25637806b1818d4.poster.avif?t=1685259725\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/3ba9fe1339217187c25637806b1818d4.webm?t=1685259725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/375320/extras/3ba9fe1339217187c25637806b1818d4.mp4?t=1685259725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
